B.a5_=s(['Check the microchip number on Pets4Pals ("Found a pet?") to make sure it is not reported lost.',"Puppies and kittens should stay with their mother until at least 8 weeks old.","Meet the animal first: clear eyes, clean ears, a healthy coat and an active manner are good signs.","Ask for the vaccination and deworming history.","Visit a member clinic in the first week for a check-up, and to register the pet or transfer ownership to you.","Think about adopting from a shelter.","A pet is a commitment for many years of time, care and cost."],t.s)
